{
  "info": {
    "name": "GeoFace — Core Service (SaaS Multi-Tenant)",
    "description": "Koleksi testing core-service GeoFace (multi-tenant SaaS).\n\nAlur pemakaian:\n1. Register Organization -> bikin tenant + Admin pertama, access_token & organization_id otomatis kesimpen.\n   (Atau Login pakai SuperAdmin platform hasil seeder: admin@geoface.com.)\n2. Create Office        -> office_id otomatis kesimpen (titik geofence tenant).\n3. Create User          -> tambah Staff/HRD di tenant (butuh role_id; lihat Get Roles).\n4. Enroll Face          -> daftarkan wajah user login.\n5. Attendance check-in  -> foto + lat/lng, divalidasi wajah + radius kantor.\n\nSemua data terisolasi per organization_id (dibawa di dalam JWT).\nSemua request (kecuali login & register-organization) otomatis kirim Bearer {{access_token}}.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "geoface-core-saas-0001"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3001"
    }
  ],
